{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "a_short_weekly_report",
  "description": "A-short weekly pipeline output: top-N per-stock M6.7 reports for one weekend run. reports[] each ALSO validated against a_short_m67_report.schema.json by write_weekly_report (this schema only gates the envelope + per-item minimal shape). Non-production, edge UNVALIDATED — boundary all false.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["schema_name", "schema_version", "generated_at", "as_of",
               "iv_feed_ref", "n_stocks", "reports", "run_lineage", "boundary"],
  "properties": {
    "schema_name": {"const": "a_short_weekly_report"},
    "schema_version": {"const": "1.0.0"},
    "generated_at": {"type": "string"},
    "as_of": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
    "iv_feed_ref": {"type": "string"},
    "n_stocks": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
    "reports": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["schema_name", "as_of", "ts_code", "m67", "machine", "boundary"],
        "properties": {
          "schema_name": {"const": "a_short_m67_report"},
          "as_of": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
          "ts_code": {"type": "string"}
        }
      }
    },
    "holdings_manual_review": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "持仓恒列入 S1: 账户持仓中无价/停牌/价格陈旧(最新 bar != 决策价格日)的票,旁路候选价格门、不进 reports[]、不伪造'持有',单列人工管理。可选(缺省=空)。",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["ts_code", "name", "reason"],
        "properties": {
          "ts_code": {"type": "string"},
          "name": {"type": "string"},
          "reason": {"type": "string"}
        }
      }
    },
    "ex_div_notices": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "#1 除权除息提示(advisory,不改决策;价已前复权):近端(as_of..as_of+窗口)已公告将除权的候选/持仓,提醒未复权市价/成本会在除权日跳变。可选(无则缺省)。",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["ts_code", "name", "ex_date", "days_to_ex"],
        "properties": {
          "ts_code": {"type": "string"},
          "name": {"type": "string"},
          "ex_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
          "days_to_ex": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}
        }
      }
    },
    "upcoming_events": {
      "type": ["object", "null"],
      "description": "4.2 forward_events: 未来已知事件日历(analysis-only,只进 M6.7、不改 EGS/TopN/result/a_short、production_effect_enabled=false)。决策日已公告(observed_at<=as_of)、event_date 在未来 window 内的 A 股事件;第1刀=限售解禁(limit_unlock),第2刀=财报预约披露(earnings_disclosure)。status=unknown_or_unavailable(provider 不可用/没查到 → 绝不当「无未来事件」) vs checked(已查;events 可空=已查无近期事件;部分(票,类)失败→ unchecked_codes)。可选/缺省 null。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["as_of", "status", "events"],
      "properties": {
        "as_of": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
        "status": {"enum": ["checked", "unknown_or_unavailable"]},
        "events": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["ts_code", "name", "event_type", "event_date", "observed_at", "source_id", "expected_effect", "confidence", "days_to_event"],
            "properties": {
              "ts_code": {"type": "string"},
              "name": {"type": "string"},
              "event_type": {"enum": ["limit_unlock", "earnings_disclosure"]},
              "event_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
              "observed_at": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
              "source_id": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
              "expected_effect": {"enum": ["manual_review", "priority_down", "sizing_down", "observe_required", "hold_watch", "informational"]},
              "confidence": {"enum": ["high", "medium", "low"]},
              "days_to_event": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}
            }
          }
        },
        "unchecked_codes": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "per-code coverage(unknown-not-clear 逐票粒度):status=checked 但部分 code 取数失败/未查成 → 列出(绝不当「无未来事件」)。可选/缺省空。",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["ts_code", "name", "event_type"],
            "properties": {"ts_code": {"type": "string"}, "name": {"type": "string"},
                           "event_type": {"enum": ["limit_unlock", "earnings_disclosure"]}}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dragon_list": {
      "type": ["object", "null"],
      "description": "4.2 Round5 龙虎榜第一刀(analysis-only · comparison-only):只记候选近 N 交易日上榜事实 + 净买卖,落 精简结论区.板块资金事件 + machine.operation_impact(source_field=dragon_list_appearance,new_entry_effect=informational/none、holding_effect=none、veto_class=none、production_effect_enabled=false);**绝不改 EGS/TopN/选股/股数/操作/否决**,阈值未定(comparison-only,见 4.2.md §9 决策4)。PIT:龙虎榜 T 日盘后发布 → trade_date<=as_of。席位分析(top_inst)留第二刀。status=unknown_or_unavailable(provider 不可用/取数全失败 → 绝不当「无上榜」) vs checked(已查;events 可空=候选近 N 日无上榜;部分交易日取数失败 → unchecked_dates)。可选/缺省 null。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["as_of", "status", "lookback_trading_days", "window_dates", "events"],
      "properties": {
        "as_of": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
        "status": {"enum": ["checked", "unknown_or_unavailable"]},
        "lookback_trading_days": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 1},
        "window_dates": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
          "description": "本轮回望的近 N 个 SSE 交易日(均 <= as_of;PIT 窗口审计)。"},
        "events": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["ts_code", "name", "trade_date", "net_amount", "reason"],
            "properties": {
              "ts_code": {"type": "string"},
              "name": {"type": "string"},
              "trade_date": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
              "net_amount": {"type": ["number", "null"], "description": "龙虎榜净买卖额(tushare top_list.net_amount 原值,不做单位换算;缺失→null)"},
              "reason": {"type": ["string", "null"], "description": "上榜原因(top_list.reason;缺失→null)"}
            }
          }
        },
        "unchecked_dates": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "per-trade-day coverage(unknown-not-clear 逐日粒度):status=checked 但部分交易日取数失败 → 列出(绝不当「无上榜」)。⊆ window_dates。可选/缺省空。",
          "items": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"}
        }
      }
    },
    "exclusion_summary": {
      "type": ["object", "null"],
      "description": "4.2 Round2: 上游(L0/L2/Stage3)过滤、无 M6.7 个股行的批次级风险摘要(counts-only, 源 analysis_input.universe_summary.excluded_counts, 不改 egs_main)。public: 仅计数, 不含个股代码/持仓, 故不暴露隐私(运行级私密路由仍按 --account 整体生效)。可选/缺省 null(本轮无上游过滤)。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["as_of", "total_excluded", "by_reason", "m67_text", "evidence_ref"],
      "properties": {
        "as_of": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"},
        "total_excluded": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
        "by_reason": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["source_field", "stage", "veto_class", "count", "pit_basis", "production_effect_enabled", "privacy_class"],
            "properties": {
              "source_field": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
              "stage": {"enum": ["l0_filter", "l2_filter", "stage3_filter"]},
              "veto_class": {"enum": ["production_hard_veto", "m67_advisory_veto"]},
              "count": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
              "pit_basis": {"enum": ["disclosure_date", "trade_date_window", "observed_date"]},
              "production_effect_enabled": {"type": "boolean"},
              "privacy_class": {"enum": ["public_tracked", "private_account"]}
            }
          }
        },
        "m67_text": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
        "evidence_ref": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["kind", "value", "as_of"],
          "properties": {
            "kind": {"enum": ["lineage_key"]},
            "value": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
            "as_of": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]{8}$"}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cash_allocation": {
      "type": ["object", "null"],
      "description": "#3 全局现金分配摘要(带 --account 才有;价格提案 §4/§11.3):多只建仓按区间上沿 entry_high 统一消耗 available_cash,不足一手→转观察。可选/缺省 null(observation-only 无)。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["available_cash_start", "allocated_cash_total", "remaining_cash"],
      "properties": {
        "available_cash_start": {"type": "number"},
        "allocated_cash_total": {"type": "number"},
        "remaining_cash": {"type": "number"}
      }
    },
    "run_lineage": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["analysis_input", "selection_bucket", "iv_feed", "account_ref", "account_status", "sizing_mode", "price_freshness"],
      "properties": {
        "analysis_input": {"type": "string"},
        "selection_bucket": {"type": "string"},
        "iv_feed": {"type": "string"},
        "account_ref": {"type": "string"},
        "account_status": {"enum": ["provided", "absent"]},
        "sizing_mode": {"enum": ["sized", "observation_only_no_account"]},
        "price_freshness": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": ["mode", "run_date", "accepted_prior_settled_date", "price_data_through"],
          "properties": {
            "mode": {"enum": ["strict_as_of", "intraday_prior_settled"]},
            "run_date": {"type": ["string", "null"], "pattern": "^\\d{8}$"},
            "accepted_prior_settled_date": {"type": ["string", "null"], "pattern": "^\\d{8}$"},
            "price_data_through": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^\\d{8}$"}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "boundary": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["production", "real_money", "is_validated_alpha", "satisfies_ship_gate"],
      "properties": {
        "production": {"const": false},
        "real_money": {"const": false},
        "is_validated_alpha": {"const": false},
        "satisfies_ship_gate": {"const": false}
      }
    }
  }
}
